  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Cluster: PoultryTechBangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This PoultryTechBangladesh project aims to contribute to the improvement of the local business climate and the development of the poultry value chain in Bangladesh, facilitate increased trade and investment in the sector and showcase proven solutions. These contributions are best achieved by the establishment of a cluster, where expertise, research, demonstration and training activities are combined by Dutch and Bangladeshi companies.The main objectives of PoultryTechBangladesh include:&#x2022;	Support Bangladesh&#x2019;s poultry sector to become more competitive (e.g. improve productivity), more sustainable (more effective usage of inputs, less impact on the environment and improved animal welfare) and more responsible;&#x2022;	Trigger and support entrepreneurship and share values about integer business practices; and&#x2022;	Identify, assess and stimulate business activities and partnerships between stakeholders in the Dutch and Bangladeshi poultry value chains, resulting in increased trade (import/export), investment and (international) cooperations.</narrative>
  </description>
